flowchart LR
  Data[(Company documents & secrets)] --> Retrieval[ACL-first Retrieval]
  Retrieval --> Classify[Classification + Provenance]
  Classify --> Gate{Provider egress policy}
  Gate -->|Approved| Compiler[Context Compiler + Redaction]
  Gate -->|Denied| Human[Human-only / Local workflow]
  Compiler --> Model[Approved Model Profile]
  Model --> Proposal[Model proposal]
  Proposal --> Auth[Policy engine + Tool Gateway]
  Auth -->|Approval required| Reviewer[Authorized human]
  Reviewer --> Action[External action]
  Auth -->|Read only allowed| Read[Authorized read]
  Auth -->|Denied| Stop[Denied + Audit]
